1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,800
This is Tom’s separate supplier identity, used for ClimateWorks work in the customer-facing Supplier Desk.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,400
External ID authenticates Tom and returns him to the branded portal under his own business account.

3
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:23,000
The application maps his stable subject to ClimateWorks and the properties and work orders that company is allowed to serve.

4
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:31,700
Tom can open an assigned delivery, but a request for another supplier’s resource is denied by the API.

5
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:39,500
That contrast matters: successful sign-in proves who Tom is. The supplier mapping and API decision prove what he may do.
